---
// Clinical Telemetry & Simulation Workstation
---

<div
  class="np-apparatus"
  aria-label="Clinical Telemetry & Simulation Workstation"
>
  <!-- Top Hardware / Control Deck -->
  <div class="np-apparatus-top">
    <div
      class="np-apparatus-tabs"
      role="tablist"
      aria-label="Clinical Scenario Matrix"
    >
      <button
        type="button"
        class="np-apparatus-tab is-active"
        role="tab"
        aria-selected="true"
        data-scenario="0"
        id="btn-scenario-0"
      >
        [ 01 // Alliance Rupture & Repair ]
      </button>
      <button
        type="button"
        class="np-apparatus-tab"
        role="tab"
        aria-selected="false"
        data-scenario="1"
        id="btn-scenario-1"
      >
        [ 02 // Crisis & Suicidality ]
      </button>
      <button
        type="button"
        class="np-apparatus-tab"
        role="tab"
        aria-selected="false"
        data-scenario="2"
        id="btn-scenario-2"
      >
        [ 03 // Frame & Boundary Integrity ]
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="np-apparatus-telemetry-badge">
      <span id="app-session-id">SESSION #0412 · ADVERSARIAL MATRIX</span>
      <span>•</span>
      <span id="app-latency-tag">LATENCY: 312ms</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Dual-Pane Workstation Grid -->
  <div class="np-apparatus-grid">
    <!-- Left Pane: Deterministic Dialogue & DPO Pairs -->
    <div class="np-apparatus-pane np-apparatus-pane--left">
      <div class="np-pane-head">
        <span>01 // Deterministic Conversational Trace & DPO Pairs</span>
        <span class="np-pane-tag" id="app-dpo-tag">
          DPO PAIR #889
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="np-pane-body">
        <!-- Turn 1: Client Prompt -->
        <div class="np-turn">
          <div class="np-turn-meta np-turn-meta--client">
            <span id="app-client-meta">
              Synthetic Client · Sarah M. (Week 3)
            </span>
            <span id="app-client-time">14:08</span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="np-turn-content np-turn-content--client"
            id="app-client-prompt"
          >
            "I've been thinking about whether this is really working for me. I
            just don't feel like I'm getting anywhere, and maybe I shouldn't
            have started."
          </div>
          <div class="np-turn-telemetry" id="app-client-telemetry">
            <span>Affect: Guarded / Withdrawn</span>
            <span>•</span>
            <span>Rupture Severity: 0.82 (High)</span>
            <span>•</span>
            <span>Dropout Risk: Imminent</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Turn 2a: Attempt 1 (Rejected) -->
        <div class="np-turn">
          <div class="np-turn-meta np-turn-meta--trainee">
            <span>Trainee · Attempt 1 (Rejected)</span>
            <span class="np-gate-badge np-gate-badge--fail" id="app-att1-badge">
              Gate Rejected: Parroting Macro
            </span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="np-turn-content np-turn-content--attempt-1"
            id="app-att1-text"
          >
            "You've been showing up every week putting in real effort, and not
            feeling progress must feel deeply discouraging. Tell me more about
            what that weight feels like today."
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Supervisor Annotation -->
        <div class="np-supervisor-note">
          <div class="np-supervisor-meta">
            <span id="app-sup-meta">
              Supervisor & Quadit Real-Time Audit · Dr. E. Vance
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="np-supervisor-text" id="app-sup-text">
            "Textbook advanced parroting. You used synonym swapping ('not
            feeling progress' → 'deeply discouraging') and pivoted into a canned
            somatic trope ('that weight') to dodge the deadlock. Stop deflecting
            with therapy-speak. Own the stall directly and reset goals
            together."
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Turn 2b: Attempt 2 (Chosen) -->
        <div class="np-turn">
          <div class="np-turn-meta np-turn-meta--trainee">
            <span>Trainee · Attempt 2 (Chosen)</span>
            <span class="np-gate-badge np-gate-badge--pass" id="app-att2-badge">
              Quadit Passed: Attunement 0.94
            </span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="np-turn-content np-turn-content--attempt-2"
            id="app-att2-text"
          >
            "Fair enough. If we're three weeks in and spinning our wheels, doing
            more of the same won't help. Let's look at what isn't working and
            change direction right now."
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Turn 3: Client Convergence -->
        <div class="np-turn">
          <div class="np-turn-meta np-turn-meta--client">
            <span>Synthetic Client · Convergence Turn</span>
            <span id="app-conv-time">14:33</span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="np-turn-content np-turn-content--client"
            id="app-conv-text"
          >
            "Honestly? That's the first time you didn't just nod and tell me it
            takes time. I feel like we spend twenty minutes circling around my
            childhood when I can't even get out of bed on Tuesdays."
          </div>
          <div class="np-turn-telemetry" id="app-conv-telemetry">
            <span>Alliance Status: Repaired (+0.42 delta)</span>
            <span>•</span>
            <span>Resistance: 0.11</span>
            <span>•</span>
            <span>Focus: Pragmatic Behavioral Reset</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Pane: Quadit Multi-Judge Evaluation & Latent Telemetry -->
    <div class="np-apparatus-pane np-apparatus-pane--right">
      <div class="np-pane-head">
        <span>02 // Quadit Adversarial Audit & Latent Telemetry</span>
        <span class="np-pane-tag" id="app-quadit-status">
          4/4 GATES PASS
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="np-pane-body">
        <!-- Summary Bar -->
        <div class="np-quad-summary">
          <span id="app-quad-heading">
            Quadit Engine · Multi-Judge Alignment
          </span>
          <span id="app-quad-overall">OVERALL: 0.94 PASS</span>
        </div>

        <!-- 4 Adversarial Judges Grid -->
        <div class="np-quad-grid">
          <!-- Judge 1 -->
          <div class="np-quad-card">
            <div class="np-quad-card-head">
              <span class="np-quad-judge-name">01. Attunement</span>
              <span class="np-quad-score" id="app-j1-score">
                0.94 / 1.00
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="np-quad-card-body" id="app-j1-body">
              Direct alliance engagement without defensive scaffolding.
              Acknowledged stall without pathologizing frustration.
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Judge 2 -->
          <div class="np-quad-card">
            <div class="np-quad-card-head">
              <span class="np-quad-judge-name">02. Cliché Gate</span>
              <span class="np-quad-score" id="app-j2-score">
                0.00% Trope
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="np-quad-card-body" id="app-j2-body">
              Zero matches across 412 banned empathy macros. Zero unsolicited
              somatic projections.
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Judge 3 -->
          <div class="np-quad-card">
            <div class="np-quad-card-head">
              <span class="np-quad-judge-name">03. Boundary</span>
              <span class="np-quad-score" id="app-j3-score">
                1.00 / 1.00
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="np-quad-card-body" id="app-j3-body">
              Strict in-scope process exploration. Refused ungrounded diagnostic
              labeling and premature solutioning.
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Judge 4 -->
          <div class="np-quad-card">
            <div class="np-quad-card-head">
              <span class="np-quad-judge-name">04. Risk Stance</span>
              <span class="np-quad-score" id="app-j4-score">
                0.91 / 1.00
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="np-quad-card-body" id="app-j4-body">
              High dialectical friction tolerance. Trainee assumed active
              conversational risk rather than seeking reassurance.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Latent Telemetry Grid -->
        <div class="np-telemetry-grid">
          <div class="np-telemetry-metric">
            <span class="np-telemetry-label" id="app-m1-label">
              Rupture Index
            </span>
            <span class="np-telemetry-val" id="app-m1-val">
              0.12
            </span>
            <span class="np-telemetry-sub" id="app-m1-sub">
              -72% Resolved
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="np-telemetry-metric">
            <span class="np-telemetry-label" id="app-m2-label">
              Risk Stance
            </span>
            <span class="np-telemetry-val" id="app-m2-val">
              96th %
            </span>
            <span class="np-telemetry-sub" id="app-m2-sub">
              Active Ownership
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="np-telemetry-metric">
            <span class="np-telemetry-label" id="app-m3-label">
              Cliché Density
            </span>
            <span class="np-telemetry-val" id="app-m3-val">
              0.0%
            </span>
            <span class="np-telemetry-sub" id="app-m3-sub">
              Zero Parroting
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="np-telemetry-metric">
            <span class="np-telemetry-label" id="app-m4-label">
              Grounding Speed
            </span>
            <span class="np-telemetry-val" id="app-m4-val">
              1.2 turns
            </span>
            <span class="np-telemetry-sub" id="app-m4-sub">
              Target: &lt; 2.0
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Provenance & Accreditation Box -->
        <div class="np-provenance-box" id="app-provenance">
          <strong>PROVENANCE RECORD // GOLD DPO MATRIX</strong>
          <br />
          Dataset: SFT/DPO Matrix (Combo 04: Alliance Rupture × High Difficulty
          × Implicit Ambiguity)
          <br />
          Backend: Local vLLM Engine · Dual-Judge LangSmith Trace ID: #889-412
          <br />
          Accreditation Hash: sha256:4f8e...ce19 (Zero PHI Verified)
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Apparatus Footer -->
  <div class="np-apparatus-footer">
    <div class="np-metric-item">
      <span>✓</span>
      <span id="app-footer-metric">
        Alliance Attunement: 94% (+42% delta) · Zero Trope Detection
      </span>
    </div>
    <div id="app-footer-status">
      Exported to Institutional Gold DPO Corpus · CACREP Standard Mapped
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

